								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1369.msg13718#msg13718">Re: Now will they follow through this time?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #7 on:</b> January 16, 2005, 10:19:42 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well I realy hope they do something with the poor healing spells of shamans.&nbsp; Especially when you are doing high end zones....There is no way you can keep up with heals and don&#039;t get me on slows not landing with malo and cripple sheesh LOL&nbsp; &nbsp;But ya never know they might do something.... Youi know what woiuld be cool and might bring people back is incorporate some of the features of EQ2 in to EQ1.&nbsp; I can kinda see that happening with the guild hall thing.&nbsp; :D&nbsp; <br /><br />Eshe
